WEBVTT

00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:30.934
Juda mantiqiy til bo'lib chiqdi.

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:33.251
Arab tilida so'z, ibora yoki

00:00:33.251 --> 00:00:34.932
gap yozish bu xuddi

00:00:34.932 --> 00:00:37.165
formula tuzgandek,

00:00:37.165 --> 00:00:39.531
chunki har bir qismi juda aniq

00:00:39.531 --> 00:00:42.383
va ko'p ma'lumotga ega.

00:00:42.383 --> 00:00:43.733
Bu biz g'arb ilm-fani deb

00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:45.248
biladigan ko'pchilik bilimlar,

00:00:45.248 --> 00:00:49.067
matematika va injeneriya deb ataydiganimiz

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.389
aslida eramizning dastlabki asrlarida 
forslar, arablar va turklar

00:00:52.389 --> 00:00:55.705
tomonidan ishlab chiqilgan.

00:00:55.705 --> 00:00:58.022
Bu arab tilida bir katta bo'lmagan 
sistemani,

00:00:58.022 --> 00:00:59.738
"al-jabr"ni o'z ichiga oladi.

00:00:59.738 --> 00:01:02.906
Uni shunday tarjima qilish mumkin: